flowchart TD
  subgraph WIN [The context window: a fixed amount of room]
    direction TB
    P1[System prompt and instructions]
    P2[Character and persona]
    P3[Active lorebook entries]
    P4[Retrieved memories]
    P5[Recent chat history]
    P6[Space saved for the reply]
  end

  WIN --> Q{Does it all fit?}
  Q -- Yes --> R[The model reads everything<br/>and writes its reply]
  Q -- No, the window is full --> S[The oldest chat messages<br/>drop out first]
  S --> T[Those details are forgotten<br/>unless they were saved as memory]
  T --> R

  classDef accent fill:#14532d,stroke:#4ade80,color:#f0fdf4;
  class P4,P6 accent;
  classDef warn fill:#3b2f14,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#fef3c7;
  class S,T warn;
